  "description": "A bird in hand is worth more than two in the bush 🦜",
  "body_html": "<p>What is an hour of your time worth? Everyone of you will have different answers. Regardless though, we all want to make as much as we can in as short of a time period as possible. But the same can be asked in the stock market. What is your time worth? Now, hopefully <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$AFRM&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> keeps running….that would be great… But in just a few hours, we beat most fund managers dream percentages. Granted, it is with an individual position and not the portfolio. But because it took so little time, I am not going to guess, speculate or ponder. I think Affirm will go much higher…we can always enter again. But set stops to lock the bird in hand. We made a lot in a short period of time…Don’t lose it!</p><p>I’ll have our end of week wrap up this afternoon. If there are any new positions or updates, I will put it in there. </p><p>Things are looking good in the market! Blow off tops are fun!</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTokDashboard</a> (going away)</strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a> </strong></em></p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
